[RULES]
RULE HighFull
IF TANK High LEVEL ABOVE 40
THEN PUMP Main STATUS IS CLOSED
PRIORITY 5

RULE HighLow
IF TANK High LEVEL BELOW 15
OR SYSTEM DEMAND > 1200
THEN PUMP Main STATUS IS OPEN
PRIORITY 4

RULE NightBoost
IF SYSTEM CLOCKTIME >= 10 PM
AND SYSTEM CLOCKTIME < 6 AM
THEN PUMP Boost SPEED IS 0.8
ELSE PUMP Boost SPEED IS 1.0
AND VALVE PRV1 SETTING IS 55

RULE LowDrain
IF TANK Low DRAINTIME < 3
THEN VALVE FCV1 SETTING IS 250
ELSE VALVE FCV1 SETTING IS 400

RULE LowFill
IF TANK Low FILLTIME BELOW 2
AND LINK P9 FLOW > 50
THEN PIPE P9 STATUS IS CLOSED
PRIORITY 1

RULE Reopen
IF TANK Low LEVEL BELOW 10
THEN PIPE P9 STATUS IS OPEN
PRIORITY 3

RULE Pressure
IF JUNCTION J10 PRESSURE BELOW 35
AND VALVE PSV1 STATUS IS ACTIVE
THEN VALVE PSV1 SETTING IS 25

RULE Morning
IF SYSTEM TIME = 30:00
THEN VALVE PBV1 STATUS IS OPEN

RULE Ignored
IF NODE J1 HEAD > 1000
THEN PUMP Main STATUS IS CLOSED
DISABLED

[EMITTERS]
 J8  0.5

